<title>USA: Superior gets Ford wheel contract.</title>
<headline>Superior gets Ford wheel contract.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Industries International Inc Tuesday said it has received a contract from Ford Motor Co to supply aluminum wheels for the Windstar minivan beginning with the 1999 model year, a contract valued in excess of $30 million in annual revenues.</p>
<p>Production is expected to begin in August 1998 at Superior's plant in Rogers, Ark.</p>
